{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion with the scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder, using avgpool aggregation, compared to the concat fusion baseline (config_007). Validation accuracy of 0.7062 is slightly lower than the concat baseline (0.7150), suggesting potential differences in fusion strategy effectiveness. Uncertainty remains about the optimal fusion method and whether other factors like image encoder architecture or aggregation choices contribute to performance variations, as no direct comparisons with alternative multimodal configurations have been made."
}

